# The build context is intentionally tiny — the AppImage is fetched inside
# the Dockerfile, not copied from the host. The only files that actually
# need to be in context are the Dockerfile itself and docker-entrypoint.sh.
# Exclude everything else aggressively.
#
# Exception: Dockerfile.headless compiles from source, so it needs Cargo files
# and the source crates directory.

*

!Dockerfile
!Dockerfile.headless
!docker-entrypoint.sh
!.dockerignore
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!src-tauri/
